@format 1
@id audio.open-normalization-monitor
@title Open normalization monitor
@area Audio
@entry input
@summary Open the single normalization-monitor window for the active Audio tab and populate it from the current monitor source.
@flow TB
@related audio.toggle-step

@alias inspector = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PInspector
@alias tab = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PAudioTab
@alias monitor = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PSMonitor
@alias source = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.LSMonitor

[input] Monitor requested <input>
- Raise the normalization-monitor request from the inspector button @ inspector.PLoudnessBodyBuild(...)
> open

[open] Replace monitor window <process>
- Forward the request from the Audio tab to the monitor window @ tab.PAudioMonitorShow(...)
- Close an existing monitor and show a new owner-bound monitor @ monitor.PSMonitorShow(...)
> update

[update] Populate monitor <output>
- Subscribe to monitor estimates and request an immediate update @ monitor.PSMonitor(...)
- Publish empty estimates while waveform data is unavailable, or before-and-after envelopes when it is available @ source.LSMonitorUpdate(...)
= The visible monitor represents the Audio tab's current source and processing plan.
